  "Wang Lung: \"What do you think you are doing?\"",
  "the second son: \"I am setting up a great grain market, and I need money to make it grow.\"",
  "the eldest son: \"You have no right to take from my fields without my permission.\"",
  "[action] steps forward and strikes the eldest son with his staff",
  "the second son: \"You have no right to speak to me like that.\"",
  "the eldest son: \"You have no right to speak to me like that.\"",
  "[action] pushes the eldest son aside and points to the fields",
  "Wang Lung: \"You have no right to speak to me like that.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I am only trying to help the family, Father. I have no intention of harming you.\"",
  "the second son: \"You have no right to speak to me like that.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I am only trying to help the family, Father. I have no intention of harming you.\"",
